WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.662
Each account becomes exactly one action.

2
00:00:02.662 --> 00:00:04.899
The group account path is: create it,

3
00:00:04.899 --> 00:00:09.370
wait while the server owner installs
it and switches the service over,

4
00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:13.225
run in parallel for thirty days,
then disable the old account.

5
00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:18.267
The delegated path is: create it, start
the migration, wait the full thirty days,

6
00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:21.419
then complete it, which
disables the old account

7
00:00:21.419 --> 00:00:24.413
and moves its service
principal names across.

8
00:00:24.413 --> 00:00:26.763
Anything else is recorded with a reason.

9
00:00:26.763 --> 00:00:30.523
And because the same inputs
always produce the same file,

10
00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:33.380
byte for byte, a reviewer
approves one hash.
